# What the Codex native-resume test vouches for: a change touching any of these
# runs `make codex-resume` in the harness's per-run check stage, with the real
# Codex on its search path, once .yoyodyne/config.yaml names it under
# `path_checks` with `needs_provider_clis: true`. A change that edits this file
# runs the test whatever the file then says, so no change can narrow the check
# that holds it.
#
# One pattern a line, in the part of .gitignore's syntax everybody reads; the
# same rules as scripts/walk-adoption.paths. docs/configuration/runs.md says
# where the test runs and why.

# The Codex adapter, and the test itself.
/internal/backend/codex/
# The directories a developer is granted and the process the adapter runs in.
/internal/execution/
# The adapter contract the Codex adapter implements.
/internal/backend/*.go
